A||N||27||grgoyl86||2001 MAFOA Fall Meeting||||1||
Z||000000||grgoyl86||10-15-2001||11:14 AM||||Hi Folks!<P>This year's MAFOA Fall Meeting will again be held at Roger and Brenda Cutter's place, Fair Play Farm in White Hall, MD.<P>The date is November 4.<P>Rather than a covered dish, this time we will have food catered. We will have Pit Beef, along with Potato Salad, Cole Slaw, Soda, etc. This will cost each attendee only $6. The catch is that we need a fairly close count of how many folks will be attending.<P>Now we need to know if you are definitely coming or maybe coming, and how many people are in your party.<P>Send a message to me at bobschlag@fieropride.com and let me know if <BR>you are a definite or a maybe.<P>Also, if anyone would like to bring desserts, snacks (chips, etc), or additional soda, that would be greatly appreciated.<P>I'll keep ya posted on any updates. Also watch the calendar page at <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A>  for the latest. <P>Let me know if you need directions or other info.<P>We hope to see YOU there!||||reg||1
Z||000001||88CoupeV6||10-15-2001||05:43 PM||||Wish I wasn't way up here in MA  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> Too long a drive. I will be at Carlisle and the Dutch classic next year though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsig.jpg">    <BR>:D  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||9
Z||000002||grgoyl86||10-20-2001||08:04 PM||||We'd like to see you there!<BR>Everyone is welcome, membership not required.<P>If you'd like to attend, please let me know soon, as we need to give the caterer a count.<P>Hope to see a lot of you there!<P>Bob||||reg||10
