Z||000008||Denny||10-22-2001||08:02 PM||||The Fierovan trip to the Cutter's for the 2000 Fall meeting (there was more behind me!).<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/caravan_sm.jpg">  <P>We will be meeting, again this year, for breakfast at the Bob Evans restaurant near Interstate 83 in York, PA. We would like a large Fierovan again this year, so join us!<P>We will be posting the time here in the near future, so stay tuned!<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Denny (edited 10-22-2001).]||||reg||6
Z||000009||grgoyl86||10-22-2001||08:53 PM||||How about we make it about 8:00.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif">  That should get us out of there about 9:00, and to Roger's about 10:00. We can play with Roger's stuff when we get there.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Another reminder: We are having a caterer for lunch, so we need a count soon. I know some people have been talking about coming, and have not let me know. PLEASE, soon. <P>Drop me a line at bobschlag@fieropride.com||||reg||3
